# Obsidian keeps two kinds of state in .obsidian/. The shared settings —
# which folders to ignore, and the decision to write markdown links rather
# than wikilinks so the docs still render on GitHub — belong to the project
# and are committed. Which panes happen to be open on one machine does not.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
